# Optional env vars for maximum PDF quality (Comp Hero institutional PDF).
# The PDF works without these — see graceful fallback behavior below.

# Mapbox public token (pk.xxx). Enables a real static map image on the Comp
# Hero PDF's "Comparable Location Map" panel. Free tier: 50k requests/mo.
# Get one at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# Without MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN, the PDF falls back to a hand-drawn inline SVG
# sketch map (still functional, just not a real geographic render).
